\begin{MintedVerbatim}[commandchars=\\\{\}]
sequenceDiagram
    actor C as Commander
    participant UI as Web Dashboard
    participant API as Python/Node Backend
    participant Sim as Virtual Robot (Docker)

    C\PYGZhy{}\PYGZgt{}\PYGZgt{}UI: Enter X, Y and click \PYGZsq{}Move\PYGZsq{}
    UI\PYGZhy{}\PYGZgt{}\PYGZgt{}API: POST /api/command \PYGZob{}x: 5, y: 10\PYGZcb{}

    activate API
    API\PYGZhy{}\PYGZgt{}\PYGZgt{}Sim: POST /api/move \PYGZob{}x: 5, y: 10\PYGZcb{}
    Sim\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZgt{}\PYGZgt{}API: 200 OK
    API\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZgt{}\PYGZgt{}UI: 200 OK
    deactivate API
\end{MintedVerbatim}
